          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "collapse_text": "Main features",
            "collapse_content": "<p>TapNest is a magnetic phone dock with three customizable NFC tap zones — designed to live on your mirror and fit seamlessly into your daily routine.<br/><br/>Tap once to launch your morning playlist. Tap again for your meditation app. Set your third zone for whatever comes next. Then snap your phone into place and let the ritual begin.<br/><br/>No digging through apps. No wet-handed scrolling. Just tap, snap, and go.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_Q7Fhxe": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "collapse_text": "Shipping & Returns",
            "collapse_content": "<p><strong>US Standard Shipping:</strong> 5-10 business day delivery.<br/><br/><strong>Shipping Email Notice:</strong> We will send you an email with the tracking number once your order has been shipped<br/><br/><strong>Global Standard Shipping:</strong> 8-15 business day delivery. Some countries in Middle East, Southeast Asia and Latin America might take up to 15-25 business days.<br/><br/>We offer a <strong>14-day return policy</strong> for a full refund or exchange, and complimentary return shipping on any defective or damaged items.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_cRztXf": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "collapse_text": "FAQ",
            "collapse_content": "<p><strong>Will TapNest fit in my space?<br/></strong>TapNest measures 7.8'' x 2.1'' x 1.1''. Make sure you have enough clear space for both the dock and your phone.<br/><br/><strong>Where can I install TapNest?<br/></strong>TapNest works best on smooth, clean, non-porous surfaces like mirrors and glossy tile. Make sure the surface is completely dry before applying.<br/><br/><strong>Does it work with my phone?<br/></strong>TapNest works best with MagSafe-compatible iPhones and cases. Other phones may require a compatible magnetic ring.<br/><br/><strong>How do I keep it looking fresh?<br/></strong>Wipe it with a soft, dry cloth. Keep sprays and excess water away from the NFC zones and magnetic surface, and check the adhesive occasionally in humid spaces.</p>"
          }
